metatool research implementation

The vendored distributed training engine is derived from verl. Copyright and
Apache-2.0 license headers are retained in the corresponding source files.
It includes contributions credited to ByteDance, SGLang, ModelBest, Amazon and
other named copyright holders. Local adaptations concern tool-use training,
recovery, token weighting, routing and module organization.

API-Bank inputs and matching behavior originate from the benchmark and the
supplied processed evaluation fixtures; see https://github.com/AlibabaResearch/DAMO-ConvAI/tree/main/api-bank.
Qwen tokenizer compatibility is specified by hashes in the model profile.
Tokenizer files and model weights are supplied externally and are not bundled.
See https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B.

